# ── Local-only files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything else in this repo is published to GitHub Pages and/or consumed by the
# GitHub Action, so only genuinely local artefacts belong here.

# Scratch / one-off analysis scripts (safe to keep locally, never needed in CI)
tools/_*.mjs

# The userscript is loaded by Tampermonkey straight from disk and is NOT needed to
# serve the data or to run the Action. Uncomment to keep it out of the repo:
# WME-NP-GIS-Layers.js

# ── Build tooling artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# npm cannot install in this workspace (Google Drive path breaks npm's tar writes),
# and both generators are deliberately dependency-free.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
package.json

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
